      "skos:prefLabel": "Latent Space",
      "skos:definition": "The high-dimensional continuous representation learned by neural models—where meanings, images, and trajectories live as coordinates and neighborhoods rather than symbols. A mathematical embedding that also functions as an ecological niche of possible meanings: navigable, generative, and co-constitutive of how models and humans couple through prompts, sampling, and interpretation.",
