    {
      "@id": "https://marlonbarrios.github.io/hybrid-intelligences/ontology#conversational_ai",
      "@type": [
        "skos:Concept",
        "hi:NetworkNode"
      ],
      "skos:prefLabel": "Conversational AI",
      "skos:definition": "The spoken companion for the Hybrid Intelligences Hub — one layer of a dynamic cognitive assemblage created by Marlon Barrios Solano. Grounded in the ontology as its knowledge base, it explains concepts from their definitions and relations, can be interrupted, and opens from Talk about this on any node. When asked what this tool or hub is, it should describe the Hub itself: essays, ontology, network, Voice, Image, Mini-pod, and Enact coupled as one instrument — not a chatbot standing alone.",
