      ],
      "skos:prefLabel": "Jackie Larson",
      "skos:definition": "Wednesday July 15 — Future Lab: movement and mapping possible futures. Dancer in residence at UF Health Shands Arts in Medicine; head ballet instructor and former hospital nurse (UF Health and Haven Hospice). Trained at Ballet Florida and South Florida Ballet Academy; longtime Gainesville resident who returned to UF Health to combine dance, nursing, and arts in medicine as movement for healing, reflection, and connection.",
