        "hi:NetworkNode"
      ],
      "skos:prefLabel": "Karla Saldaña Ochoa",
      "skos:definition": "Monday July 13 — AI and architecture. Ecuadorian architect and Assistant Professor in UF’s School of Architecture; Master of Advanced Studies in Landscape Architecture and Ph.D. from ETH Zurich on integrating artificial and human intelligence for disaster response. Leads SHARE Lab, developing human-centered AI for architectural practice at building and urban scale.",
